<figure id="S5.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Reference results over <math id="S5.T3.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\calibrationSplit" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>ca</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\calibrationSplit</annotation></semantics></math> to illustrate the behavior of <math id="S5.T3.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q^{\prime}_{\rm{min}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#3333FF;" mathcolor="#3333FF">q</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#3333FF;" mathcolor="#3333FF">min</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#3333FF;" mathcolor="#3333FF">′</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q^{\prime}_{\rm{min}}</annotation></semantics></math>. The value of <math id="S5.T3.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q^{\prime}_{\rm{min}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q^{\prime}_{\rm{min}}</annotation></semantics></math> tends to increase as the accuracy over <math id="S5.T3.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\calibrationSplit" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>ca</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\calibrationSplit</annotation></semantics></math> decreases, reflecting a more conservative <math id="S5.T3.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hrRegionFull" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">high-reliability</mtext><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hrRegionFull</annotation></semantics></math> region. Alg. <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ 3.2.1 Controlling Selective Classification Recall ‣ 3.2 Evaluating Selective Classification ‣ 3 Methods ‣ Similarity-Distance-Magnitude Activations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> failed to find a finite <math id="S5.T3.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q^{\prime}_{\rm{min}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q^{\prime}_{\rm{min}}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="S5.T3.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\modelMixtralSDM" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">Mixtral8x7B+sdm</mtext><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\modelMixtralSDM</annotation></semantics></math> over the <math id="S5.T3.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\datasetFactcheck" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">Factcheck</mtext><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\datasetFactcheck</annotation></semantics></math> calibration set at <math id="S5.T3.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=0.95" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=0.95</annotation></semantics></math>, so for reference, we also show the <math id="S5.T3.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hrRegionFull" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">high-reliability</mtext><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hrRegionFull</annotation></semantics></math> region at <math id="S5.T3.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=0.94" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.94</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=0.94</annotation></semantics></math>. </figcaption>
