<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide the results for the far out-of-distribution (OOD) shuffled datasets in Section <a href="#A1.SS1" title="A.1 Far OOD Shuffled Datasets ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Similarity-Distance-Magnitude Activations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a>. Additional implementation details are included in Section <a href="#A1.SS2" title="A.2 Additional Implementation Details ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Similarity-Distance-Magnitude Activations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Far OOD Shuffled Datasets</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ A.1 Far OOD Shuffled Datasets ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Similarity-Distance-Magnitude Activations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> shows results for the <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\datasetSentimentShuffled" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">SentimentShuffled</mtext><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\datasetSentimentShuffled</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\datasetSentimentOODShuffled" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">SentimentOODShuffled</mtext><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\datasetSentimentOODShuffled</annotation></semantics></math> datasets, and Table <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ A.1 Far OOD Shuffled Datasets ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Similarity-Distance-Magnitude Activations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> shows results for the <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\datasetFactcheckShuffled" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">FactcheckShuffled</mtext><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\datasetFactcheckShuffled</annotation></semantics></math> datasets, as discussed in Section <a href="#S5" title="5 Results ‣ Similarity-Distance-Magnitude Activations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Comparison of estimators for the <span id="A1.T4.6" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">shuffled</span> sentiment datasets, with <span id="A1.T4.7" class="ltx_text"><math id="A1.T4.m4" class="ltx_Math" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2FFF2;" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2FFF2;" mathbackground="#F2FFF2">α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><math id="A1.T4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=0.95" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>0.95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=0.95</annotation></semantics></math>. <span id="A1.T4.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2FFF2;">R</span> indicates all predictions were rejected, which is preferred over falling <span id="A1.T4.9" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFF2F2;">under</span> the expected accuracy.
<math id="A1.T4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=|\text{Admitted}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mtext>Admitted</mtext><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=|\text{Admitted}|</annotation></semantics></math>, the count of non-rejected documents.</figcaption>
